    <string name="settings_connectors_title">Connectors</string>
    <string name="settings_connectors_hint">Connect the apps and services Diafit should get data from. You can connect as many as you like, then choose below which one feeds each kind of data.</string>
    <string name="settings_hint_aaps">In AAPS, turn on its data broadcast so Diafit receives treatments (Config Builder → Sync → NSClient, and the Data broadcaster plugin for temp basals). Diafit doesn\'t need a login.</string>
    <string name="settings_hint_xdrip">In xDrip+: Settings → Inter-app settings → Broadcast locally. Diafit then receives every reading; no login needed.</string>
    <string name="settings_hint_juggluco">In Juggluco: Settings → Data exchange → Glucodata broadcast, then switch on Diafit in the list of apps. No login needed.</string>
